The '''Winter Kiosk''' was made available to all players as part of [[Winter 2022]]. It is a [[:Category:Kiosks|Kiosk]], staffed by an [[Assistant]], which is frequented by [[Staff]] and [[Students]] to reduce their [[hunger]].

==Description==
===Appearance===
A red food kiosk decorated with white snow patterns on both the top and bottom. There is a Christmas wreath below the pavilion, a Christmas tree decorated with gifts at the top, a pair of Christmas socks, and a Christmas pudding sign.

===Function===
[[Students]] and [[Staff|members of staff]] may frequent the Winter Kiosk to reduce their [[hunger]]. The visitors of this kiosk will experience the ''Festive Cheer'' [[Feelings|feeling]], which will increase their [[Happiness]]. Visitors change their visual appearance by putting a blue crown on top of their heads until the buff runs out.
[[File:Festive-Cheer-Appearance.jpg|150px|left]]{{clrl}}

==Requirements==
===Placement===
{{i2|Campus Building|25px|alt=Campus-Building-Icon}}
{{i2|Outside|25px|alt=Outside-Icon}}

===Staff===
An {{i2|Assistant|25px|alt=Assistant-Icon|br=no}} will be required to run the Winter Kiosk.

==Unused Content==
{{MainIcon|alt=Winter-Kiosk-v1-Icon}}
[[File:Winter-Kiosk-v1.jpg|right|150px]]
During an early beta test, the Winter Kiosk consisted of a variation of the '''Cosy Kiosk''' from [[w:c:two-point-hospital:Two Point Hospital|Two Point Hospital]], with decorations consistent with other [[Winter 2022]] items. Its final release is a kiosk in the same style as the others in the game ([[#Kiosk Varieties|see below]]), with a festive theme.
